<title>USA: Cinco MUD 8, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>Cinco MUD 8, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce said it won</p>
<p>$1.225 million of Cinco MUD 8, Texas, general obligation</p>
<p>bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.0942 percent.</p>
